{
    "title": "Real Car Driving Midnight Club",
    "description": "Do you want to try a super sport car simulator? Now you can drive, drift and feel a racing sports car! Be a furious racer on a whole city for you. No need to brake because of traffic or racing other rival vehicles, so you can perform illegal stunt actions and run full speed without the police chasing you! Beat traffic in these fuel dragsters across short distances in motor sport racing games.\r\n\r\n\u2022 BEST CAR GAMES: Upgrade this free car game by restoring your rides to their former glory in the Legends workshop as you go for speed.\r\n\u2022 CAR CUSTOMIZE: Collect some of the most iconic autos from the 60s, 70s, 80s and yes, the 90s! Customize your ride to find the car you need to climb the hill for your best racing experience. Go racing post midnight in this free driving game.\r\n\u2022 CITY CAR DRIVING: Tear up the road, mile after km, with fast, contemporary cars in free racing games for boys or girls.\r\n\u2022 FURIOUS DRIFTING: Master oversteering, opposite lock, oversteers and countersteering to become a drifting games, parking games, and car parking expert.\r\n\u2022 NO LIMIT: To your 3D tuning of these epic cars; with a wide range of paint, nitro, wheels, brake calipers and turbo options; you can make a fearsome rebel drift racing car, or a funny car.\r\n\u2022 NO WIFI GAMES: Play these offline car games to master 9 second cars wherever you go.\r\n\r\nNeed for speed to burn the asphalt  and compete with players across the world in your custom built cars, also known as the fast and the furious, is a media franchise centered on a series of action games that are largely concerned with street racing, heists, spies, and family.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to try a super sport car simulator? Now you can drive, drift and feel a racing sports car! Be a furious racer on a whole city for you. No need to brake because of traffic or racing other rival vehicles, so you can perform illegal stunt actions and run full speed without the police chasing you! Beat traffic in these fuel dragsters across short distances in motor sport racing games.<br><br>\u2022 BEST CAR GAMES: Upgrade this free car game by restoring your rides to their former glory in the Legends workshop as you go for speed.<br>\u2022 CAR CUSTOMIZE: Collect some of the most iconic autos from the 60s, 70s, 80s and yes, the 90s! Customize your ride to find the car you need to climb the hill for your best racing experience. Go racing post midnight in this free driving game.<br>\u2022 CITY CAR DRIVING: Tear up the road, mile after km, with fast, contemporary cars in free racing games for boys or girls.<br>\u2022 FURIOUS DRIFTING: Master oversteering, opposite lock, oversteers and countersteering to become a drifting games, parking games, and car parking expert.<br>\u2022 NO LIMIT: To your 3D tuning of these epic cars; with a wide range of paint, nitro, wheels, brake calipers and turbo options; you can make a fearsome rebel drift racing car, or a funny car.<br>\u2022 NO WIFI GAMES: Play these offline car games to master 9 second cars wherever you go.<br><br>Need for speed to burn the asphalt  and compete with players across the world in your custom built cars, also known as the fast and the furious, is a media franchise centered on a series of action games that are largely concerned with street racing, heists, spies, and family.",
